d0e273-3d34-40d9-8183-df2a8c6723d9\" />\r\n\r\nI do understand that the rendering works differently in the scene editor. I guess more needs to be done for this to work.\r\n\r\n[mrp_blur_label_2025-12-19_22-06-25.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24259358/mrp_blur_label_2025-12-19_22-06-25.zip)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675215160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675220261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107751#issuecomment-3675220261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107751","id":3675220261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bD2kl","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T14:10:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T14:10:02Z","body":"I'd suggest opening a